    "doshas": {
      "Kala Sarpa Dosha": "<html>There is no Kala Sarpa Dosha in this horoscope.<br><br></html>",
      "Manglik Dosha": "<html>According to classical reckoning, Mars occupying the 1st, 2nd, 4th, 7th, 8th or 12th house from the reference point constitutes this combination, the houses counted varying by regional tradition. Classically associated with force and friction in matters of partnership, and with a temperament that asks for patience from both sides. Classical texts set out several conditions under which the indication is held to be cancelled or much reduced.<br><br>The 7th is the Kalathra Sthana, which directly represents marriage. The placement of Mars here can make the natives aggressive and dominating and may lead to differences of opinion between spouses, sufferings, and sorrow.<br><br>Though there is a Mars dosha placement in this chart, the classical exceptions listed below are held to cancel or greatly reduce the indication.<br><br>\tMars in Leo or Aquarious<br><br>\tMars is in association or aspected by Jupiter or Saturn<br><br>\tWhen Mars is in own house, uccham or in friend's' house leads to reduced effects<br><br></html>",
      "Pitru Dosha": "<html>Pitru Dosha is described as an obligation carried down the ancestral line. It is reckoned when the Sun or Moon is in conjunction with, or aspected by, Rahu or Ketu, and classical texts treat the indication as more pronounced when that combination falls in the 1st, 5th, 8th or 9th house. Classically associated with obstruction in matters of lineage and continuity, alongside an indication of duties owed to the forebears. Remedial observances are prescribed for it. There is pitru dosha in this horoscope for the following reasons:<br><br>Either sun, moon or Rahu is in ninth house.<br><br>Either sun, moon, rahu or ketu has been afflicted by malefic planets like Mars or Saturn<br><br></html>",
      "Guru Chandala Dosha": "<html>There is no Guru Chandal dosha on this horoscope.<br><br></html>",
      "Ganda Moola Dosha": "<html>There is no ganda moola dosha in this horoscope.<br><br>",
